// Master vocabulary. GLOBAL: these names and ids are the same on every map, so
// `masterNear is roshi` means the same thing wherever the content is loaded and
// a lesson either validates everywhere or nowhere.
//
// Where each master stands is per-map and lives in rules/masters_<mapname>.def,
// written by the in-game masterplace command.
//
// The id is stated rather than taken from file order, because it is what
// travels to the client in PERS_TRAINING_MASTER and what a rule compiles to.
// Reordering this file must not renumber a master out from under content.
// Ids are 1-based; 0 is the masterNear value 'none'.

master  1  roshi
master  2  kingKai
